  `Std.U32.max = 2 ^ 32 - 1`.
* The notation `10#u32` denotes the constant `10` of type `Std.U32`.
* The sum `x + 10#u32` has the type `Result Std.U32`. It is `ok z` with
  `z.val = x.val + 10` when this sum is at most `Std.U32.max`, and it fails
  otherwise.
* The comment above the definition records the name of the Rust function, its
  position in the source file, and its visibility.
